   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES17:24dbe",
   "off": 150974,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "バラックに入ると 怪我人の\r食事を作っていた老婆が\r顔をあげた\u0010\b",
   "en": "When we stepped into the shack, an old woman cooking for the injured looked up.\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES17:24e13",
   "off": 151059,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「この傷では 当分\r  ここから 動かすわけには\r  いかないよ」\u0010",
   "en": "\"With wounds like these, he can't be moved from here for a good while, dearie.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES17:24e67",
   "off": 151143,
   "op": "1c",
   "group": "npc",
   "jp": "トールマン",
   "en": "Tallman",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES17:24e81",
   "off": 151169,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「他にも 怪我人を\r  みつけたら\r  連れておいで」\u0010",
   "en": "\"If you find any more injured, bring 'em here.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES17:24eb8",
   "off": 151224,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「わたしは\r  当分動けそうにない…」\u0010",
   "en": "\"Looks like I won't be moving for a while...\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  }
 ]
